                                        labelString = This is a demo of the Open Motif Internationalized Extended List widget.\
\
The Internationalized Extended List provides multi-column list \
capabilities, which are not available in Motif. It uses XmStrings \
exclusively, and is able to display color pixmaps in the leftmost \
column. Search capability is built into the widget and is accessed \
through the Find Area below the list.\
\
Selections may be done in single select mode or extended select mode.\
There are convenience routines for selecting and unselecting rows \
programmatically as well. To see some of the features of this widget, \
add some data to the list, by selecting one of the players from the \
Add Player option menu.\
\
The Extended List can sort rows based on the currently selected column \
using sort routines provided by the developer. Select different\
column titles to see what order that sort routine produces. \
\
Search the list by typing a string into the text field next \
to the Find button. Then select the Find button or hit \
the Enter key to initiate the search. If the string is found, the \
row that contains it will be made viewable and selected. If not \
found,the Extended list will issue a beep.\
\
The Find area may be unmanaged by setting the "showFind" resource \
to False.See how the widget looks without the Find area taking up space.\
\
There is a convenience routine for unselecting rows programmatically \
Select the Unselect Current pushbutton to see it work.\
\
To see how the firstRow and firstCol resources work, select the \
Row 2, Col 1 button. The extended list will make that the upper left \
row and column. Remember, the list cannot be scrolled past its end.  \
Therefore, if making a particular row and col the upper leftmost would \
cause the list to scroll past its boundaries, it will scroll to the\
end
                                        alignment = alignment_beginning
                                    }
                                } explain_label
                            }
